      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_e57c4aa2",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: muslim_porn_star_goat; hasOverallIntent: hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a goat wearing sunglasses, with the text 'muslim' at the top and 'porn star' at the bottom. This juxtaposition creates a derogatory and offensive stereotype by equating Muslims with the hypersexualized and demeaning trope of 'porn star,' which is a form of Islamophobia. The meme uses visual humor to mock and dehumanize a religious group by associating it with a sexualized and morally condemned caricature. This is a hateful meme as it directly attacks a protected characteristic (religion) through a demeaning and false analogy, aiming to provoke negative stereotypes and reinforce prejudice against Muslims.",
