    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_60e8390d",
      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "mapping_1",
      "label": "goat is mapped as 'muslim' and 'porn star'",
      "description": "The visual entity 'goat_with_sunglasses' is mapped onto the textual entities 'muslim' and 'porn star' through the meme's juxtaposition. The goat, with its anthropomorphic presentation (wearing sunglasses and looking directly at the camera), is used as a visual stand-in for the derogatory stereotypes associated with Muslims ('muslim') and hypersexualized individuals ('porn star'). This creates a false analogy where the goat is equated with these offensive labels, serving as the central analogical mapping in the meme.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
